WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
APRS map and packet list in a split tmux workspace.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Select older packets with Down. The selected map marker follows the report.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Open the selected packet inspector with x.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Close the inspector; focus the map and hide the packet panel.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Zoom in twice with +.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Pan right and up, then return left and down.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Zoom out twice and restore the packet panel.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Ctrl-B, 1: switch to the Packets tmux window.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Ctrl-B, 2: switch to Shell.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Ctrl-B, 0: return to the map workspace.
